version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-02"
keywords:
  - epidemiology
  - biostatistics
  - public health
  - meta-analysis
  - survey sampling
  - digital public good
  - open source
abstract: >-
  EpiPlus is a free, open-source epidemiology and biostatistics calculator
  suite implementing formulas not already covered by OpenEpi, EpiCalc, or
  EpiStat: survey sampling design (Design Effect, cluster and stratified
  sample size), population burden indicators (DALY, PAF, age
  standardization), clinical and effect measures (vaccine effectiveness,
  NNT/NNH, SMD), statistical modeling (Poisson regression, Bayesian
  diagnostic test performance), and meta-analysis (fixed- and
  random-effects pooling with forest plots). Every calculator is validated
  against independent published worked examples, documented in
  VALIDATION.md. The app runs entirely client-side as an installable,
  offline-capable Progressive Web App, with no data collection.
